    cml:logicSummary "Temporal interval for reporting compliance with this Act." ;
    cml:premiseText "The Director may, by notice in the Gazette, declare the applicant to be an identifying cash dealer if satisfied that such a declaration would not be inconsistent with the objects of this Act." ;
